          "title": "You'll want to know: പത്രസമ്മേളനം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പത്രസമ്മേളനം — patrasammēḷanaṁ — \"a press conference\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മാനേജർ ഇന്ന് ഒരു പത്രസമ്മേളനം നടത്തി. mānējar innŭ oru patrasammēḷanaṁ naṭatti. The manager held a press conference today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A press conference is held: പത്രസമ്മേളനം (patrasammēḷanaṁ) നടത്തുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പത്രസമ്മേളനം (patrasammēḷanaṁ) is built from പത്രം (patraṁ), \"a newspaper\", and Sanskrit sammelana, \"a meeting together, a union\" (Monier-Williams): a meeting called for the papers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
