          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പെരുപ്പിക്കുക (peruppikkuka) is native Dravidian, a causative built on പെരു (peru), \"great, large\" (DEDR 4411): to exaggerate is to make a thing bigger than it was."
